{"id":"neobkhodimost_","lemma":"необходимость","pos":"noun","rank":3086,"glosses":["necessity, need"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/7/7b/Ru-%D0%BD%D0%B5%D0%BE%D0%B1%D1%85%D0%BE%D0%B4%D0%B8%D0%BC%D0%BE%D1%81%D1%82%D1%8C.ogg/Ru-%D0%BD%D0%B5%D0%BE%D0%B1%D1%85%D0%BE%D0%B4%D0%B8%D0%BC%D0%BE%D1%81%D1%82%D1%8C.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"необходимости","plural":"необходимости"},"examples":[{"text":"Ей нет необходимости работать.","en":"There is no need for her to work.","words":[{"g":"(to) her"},{"g":"no / there isn't"},null,{"g":"to work"}]},{"text":"Это необходимость.","en":"It's a necessity.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1274771","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},null]},{"text":"Нет необходимости делать это сейчас.","en":"It isn't necessary to do that now.","words":[{"g":"no / there isn't"},null,{"g":"to make, to do"},{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"now"}]},{"text":"В этом есть необходимость.","en":"There is a need for that.","words":[{"g":"in"},null,{"g":"there is / to eat"},null]},{"text":"Тебе нет необходимости врать.","en":"You don't need to lie.","words":[{"g":"(to) you","l":"ты"},{"g":"no / there isn't"},null,{"g":"to lie"}]}]}